\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. All things are possible to Him
\par That can in Jesu's name believe:
\par Lord, I no more Thy truth blaspheme,
\par Thy truth I lovingly receive;
\par I can, I do believe in Thee,
\par All things are possible to me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The most impossible of all
\par Is, that I e'er from sin should cease;
\par Yet shall it be, I know it shall:
\par Jesus, look to Thy faith fulness!
\par If nothing is too hard for Thee,
\par All things are possible to me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Though earth and hell the word gainsay,
\par The word of God can never fail;
\par The Lamb shall take my sins away,
\par 'Tis certain, though impossible;
\par The thing impossible shall be,
\par All things are possible to me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. All things are possible to God,
\par To Christ, the power of God in man,
\par To me, when I am all renewed,
\par When I in Christ am formed again,
\par And witness, from all sin set free,
\par All things are possible to me.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

